      "dcterms:description": "{\"action\":\"\",\"actor\":\"\",\"alternative_quotes\":[\"(1) When performance has begun of the inspection of the individual's person or accessible property before entering a sterile area, or before boarding an aircraft for which screening is conducted under this subchapter;\",\"(2) When the individual is entering or in a sterile area; or\",\"(3) When the individual is attempting to board or onboard an aircraft for which screening is conducted under §§ 1544.201, 1546.201, or 1562.23 of this chapter.\"],\"applies_to\":[],\"assertion_ids\":[\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:44bf6ba55ca04d1e4dda01d5fd69e897f2213ec039bf232ccfb212d9cd168467\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:bae23c8db499893308156730dcbcc1045187b43c03d0c03bf2a9075b8d587667\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:8a3de214de12395be3577f7064c4074600a05b7641e33888f10cd5e922e766bf\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:6b02034b5beb98204cb07a7efdb02f531aeab5c9475b6976e14823353467757e\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:66cfab3efe3e9a0177d3c50e011835aeeaf9007b7be79c59c1f16e3a76ae27ff\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:99ab6001fe5ac4d04a6ac0e20e2b0bb1442fda0a21ab76c3ed99b98c38732237\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:c9b05e9259a74a486abd23dda1acfd13e0ba5a685b3a4c07d746dc40871c4131\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:757c3f5cafab948692861b6d0a63f84f6d7bc1fbd71002d0fa2ca2015e04f592\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:22de5eef650e5950ac21c26202ab8c53b156e5980b8276d35c7fb35fd0dad5cc\"],\"choice_quote\":\"(1) When performance has begun of the inspection of the individual's person or accessible property before entering a sterile area, or before boarding an aircraft for which screening is conducted under this subchapter;\\n\\n(2) When the individual is entering or in a sterile area; or\\n\\n(3) When the individual is attempting to board or onboard an aircraft for which screening is conducted under §§ 1544.201, 1546.201, or 1562.23 of this chapter.\",\"choice_text\":\"The prohibition applies: (1) when performance has begun of the inspection of the individual's person or accessible property before entering a sterile area, or before boarding an aircraft for which screening is conducted under this subchapter; (2) when the individual is entering or in a sterile area; or (3) when the individual is attempting to board or onboard an aircraft for which screening is conducted under §§ 1544.201, 1546.201, or 1562.23 of this chapter.\",\"claimants\":[],\"concepts\":[],\"context_quotes\":[],\"effective_periods\":[],\"end\":769,\"evidence\":[{\"end\":769,\"field\":\"summary\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:85:769:sha256-f0b5b25a137f7cce76590536680b771afaf6acb0a5936dc368649100eb2ba93d\",\"quote\":\"(a) On an individual's person or accessible property—prohibitions. Except as provided in paragraph (b) of this section, an individual may not have a weapon, explosive, or incendiary, on or about the individual's person or accessible property—\\n\\n(1) When performance has begun of the inspection of the individual's person or accessible property before entering a sterile area, or before boarding an aircraft for which screening is conducted under this subchapter;\\n\\n(2) When the individual is entering or in a sterile area; or\\n\\n(3) When the individual is attempting to board or onboard an aircraft for which screening is conducted under §§ 1544.201, 1546.201, or 1562.23 of this chapter.\",\"start\":85},{\"end\":769,\"field\":\"logic_text\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:85:769:sha256-f0b5b25a137f7cce76590536680b771afaf6acb0a5936dc368649100eb2ba93d\",\"quote\":\"(a) On an individual's person or accessible property—prohibitions. Except as provided in paragraph (b) of this section, an individual may not have a weapon, explosive, or incendiary, on or about the individual's person or accessible property—\\n\\n(1) When performance has begun of the inspection of the individual's person or accessible property before entering a sterile area, or before boarding an aircraft for which screening is conducted under this subchapter;\\n\\n(2) When the individual is entering or in a sterile area; or\\n\\n(3) When the individual is attempting to board or onboard an aircraft for which screening is conducted under §§ 1544.201, 1546.201, or 1562.23 of this chapter.\",\"start\":85},{\"end\":226,\"field\":\"modality\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:219:226:sha256-0007a8bea4dcd3f6b1490fc7199650f1046713dd92d9314e1f2ede6946fcd999\",\"quote\":\"may not\",\"start\":219},{\"end\":769,\"field\":\"choice_text\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:329:769:sha256-22dcfb8db4667ffae9d7a7b17b48ca968730412e4f33fe6a7d2d7577439d118b\",\"quote\":\"(1) When performance has begun of the inspection of the individual's person or accessible property before entering a sterile area, or before boarding an aircraft for which screening is conducted under this subchapter;\\n\\n(2) When the individual is entering or in a sterile area; or\\n\\n(3) When the individual is attempting to board or onboard an aircraft for which screening is conducted under §§ 1544.201, 1546.201, or 1562.23 of this chapter.\",\"start\":329},{\"end\":327,\"field\":\"scope_text:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:85:327:sha256-a32c8dfb7196d8707007190b60d5fd2a41cfc2faf3efbb1eecb19d61e6401457\",\"quote\":\"(a) On an individual's person or accessible property—prohibitions. Except as provided in paragraph (b) of this section, an individual may not have a weapon, explosive, or incendiary, on or about the individual's person or accessible property—\",\"start\":85},{\"end\":546,\"field\":\"alternative:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:329:546:sha256-d5fe1a750d86ba4e476f3b755b0d6c324a6a6e30d69b292a6b13efb667ae044b\",\"quote\":\"(1) When performance has begun of the inspection of the individual's person or accessible property before entering a sterile area, or before boarding an aircraft for which screening is conducted under this subchapter;\",\"start\":329},{\"end\":608,\"field\":\"alternative:1\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:548:608:sha256-c139a639c1d605a7d307ad6a66eb81168e6c66c3a021b60c289053565aaa41c2\",\"quote\":\"(2) When the individual is entering or in a sterile area; or\",\"start\":548},{\"end\":769,\"field\":\"alternative:2\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:610:769:sha256-3303604764789bed72f78d4739f5fe14e317e2fcc6c61bed6be2c6efd864dead\",\"quote\":\"(3) When the individual is attempting to board or onboard an aircraft for which screening is conducted under §§ 1544.201, 1546.201, or 1562.23 of this chapter.\",\"start\":610}],\"id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:revision:213155e205ba2f3acdcc7ec6cd4d91c84aaa9c23c9d8a5004ae2cf0ec6c21f82\",\"jurisdiction\":\"\",\"jurisdiction_quote\":\"\",\"kind\":\"prohibition\",\"logic_text\":\"(a) On an individual's person or accessible property—prohibitions. Except as provided in paragraph (b) of this section, an individual may not have a weapon, explosive, or incendiary, on or about the individual's person or accessible property—\\n\\n(1) When performance has begun of the inspection of the individual's person or accessible property before entering a sterile area, or before boarding an aircraft for which screening is conducted under this subchapter;\\n\\n(2) When the individual is entering or in a sterile area; or\\n\\n(3) When the individual is attempting to board or onboard an aircraft for which screening is conducted under §§ 1544.201, 1546.201, or 1562.23 of this chapter.\",\"meaning_assertion_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:22de5eef650e5950ac21c26202ab8c53b156e5980b8276d35c7fb35fd0dad5cc\",\"modality\":\"must_not\",\"modality_quote\":\"may not\",\"object\":\"\",\"occurrence_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:occurrence:cbaf3f02e62d005c3066bdcfc02a8313046f40802a6e4a8260ae62d7cd8d9a75\",\"origin\":\"aiSuggested\",\"quote\":\"(a) On an individual's person or accessible property—prohibitions. Except as provided in paragraph (b) of this section, an individual may not have a weapon, explosive, or incendiary, on or about the individual's person or accessible property—\\n\\n(1) When performance has begun of the inspection of the individual's person or accessible property before entering a sterile area, or before boarding an aircraft for which screening is conducted under this subchapter;\\n\\n(2) When the individual is entering or in a sterile area; or\\n\\n(3) When the individual is attempting to board or onboard an aircraft for which screening is conducted under §§ 1544.201, 1546.201, or 1562.23 of this chapter.\",\"references\":[\"paragraph (b)\",\"§§ 1544.201\",\"1546.201\",\"1562.23\"],\"relation\":\"none\",\"rule_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:rule:1658ec4e0ca6c48114c894e20b9f2d9cf437ae7e1f735e1add6069ac4dc04db0\",\"scope_quotes\":[\"(a) On an individual's person or accessible property—prohibitions. Except as provided in paragraph (b) of this section, an individual may not have a weapon, explosive, or incendiary, on or about the individual's person or accessible property—\"],\"scope_text\":\"Except as provided in paragraph (b) of 49 CFR 1540.111.\",\"section_id\":\"section-1\",\"start\":85,\"summary\":\"Except as provided in paragraph (b) of 49 CFR 1540.111, an individual may not have a weapon, explosive, or incendiary, on or about the individual's person or accessible property: (1) when performance has begun of the inspection of the individual's person or accessible property before entering a sterile area, or before boarding an aircraft for which screening is conducted under this subchapter; (2) when the individual is entering or in a sterile area; or (3) when the individual is attempting to board or onboard an aircraft for which screening is conducted under §§ 1544.201, 1546.201, or 1562.23 of this chapter.\",\"target_ids\":[],\"typed_values\":[]}",
