    {
      "@id": "urn:rulespec:document-understanding:revision:47744e9e62409b2abd5e0005cb5ef238f096cfc06a06caaa02ac5a0c8dfac4a3",
      "@type": "rkaf:Artifact",
      "rkaf:hasArtifactIdentifier": "urn:rulespec:document-understanding:revision:47744e9e62409b2abd5e0005cb5ef238f096cfc06a06caaa02ac5a0c8dfac4a3",
      "rkaf:artifactIdentifierScheme": "rkaf:urn-persistent",
      "rkaf:hasContentDigest": "sha256:ac03aaa2476079eb3249826b8c251710775ebfecc31b94f977d1cc3725d35ee6",
      "dcterms:format": "application/json",
      "dcterms:description": "{\"action\":\"\",\"actor\":\"\",\"alternative_quotes\":[\"(1) Law enforcement personnel required to carry a firearm or other weapons while in the performance of law enforcement duty at the airport.\",\"(2) An individual authorized to carry a weapon in accordance with §§ 1544.219, 1544.221, 1544.223, 1546.211, or subpart B of part 1562 of this chapter.\",\"(3) An individual authorized to carry a weapon in a sterile area under a security program.\"],\"applies_to\":[],\"assertion_ids\":[\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:a2fb21c1bd8ef76d8fc3c33487030df528b1133f67a1e6259dc422b8c8db26d8\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:64675b78d3ec8d8082d2a393eb70f61efc40bf35c078c885ff46df6826909a08\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:37d8b6a950e404535502c3e71c99c038ed3c5bd98619ae81b4fc1206ff002a32\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:8f60a8b0e82ab0f0c9a123a197f10c28b01b93ee7b33af611f8ad1f104e20e72\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:607486c88f4b87d67f80dc753eafc237cacf4994f83087c49676977ea97e4c50\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:0d6fcc10c2e636fff52c1617a30d4282fb6cff09af69a4b1f0f9d4caafd73640\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:1600b9f7ba8395b63946e3508a9cdb3882956688e34a6fd6a6dd768eab9ddf7e\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:d6894805f4405b62f977bafd88ad999407a61b8e2991984d0516f0d26455f00c\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:b4fa5658818398dca12112a4cc0a95d15a526aba9789c3b9e1cc32052a81c0a0\"],\"choice_quote\":\"(b) On an individual's person or accessible property—permitted carriage of a weapon. Paragraph (a) of this section does not apply as to carriage of firearms and other weapons if the individual is one of the following:\\n\\n(1) Law enforcement personnel required to carry a firearm or other weapons while in the performance of law enforcement duty at the airport.\\n\\n(2) An individual authorized to carry a weapon in accordance with §§ 1544.219, 1544.221, 1544.223, 1546.211, or subpart B of part 1562 of this chapter.\\n\\n(3) An individual authorized to carry a weapon in a sterile area under a security program.\",\"choice_text\":\"Paragraph (a) of 49 CFR 1540.111 does not apply if the individual is one of the following: (1) law enforcement personnel required to carry a firearm or other weapons while in the performance of law enforcement duty at the airport; (2) an individual authorized to carry a weapon in accordance with §§ 1544.219, 1544.221, 1544.223, 1546.211, or subpart B of part 1562 of this chapter; or (3) an individual authorized to carry a weapon in a sterile area under a security program.\",\"claimants\":[],\"concepts\":[],\"context_quotes\":[],\"effective_periods\":[],\"end\":1374,\"evidence\":[{\"end\":1374,\"field\":\"summary\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:771:1374:sha256-af1a8c92b280b982ac594e1fcc08434ad2ae0eee06bd57850e156e234140fad1\",\"quote\":\"(b) On an individual's person or accessible property—permitted carriage of a weapon. Paragraph (a) of this section does not apply as to carriage of firearms and other weapons if the individual is one of the following:\\n\\n(1) Law enforcement personnel required to carry a firearm or other weapons while in the performance of law enforcement duty at the airport.\\n\\n(2) An individual authorized to carry a weapon in accordance with §§ 1544.219, 1544.221, 1544.223, 1546.211, or subpart B of part 1562 of this chapter.\\n\\n(3) An individual authorized to carry a weapon in a sterile area under a security program.\",\"start\":771},{\"end\":1374,\"field\":\"logic_text\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:771:1374:sha256-af1a8c92b280b982ac594e1fcc08434ad2ae0eee06bd57850e156e234140fad1\",\"quote\":\"(b) On an individual's person or accessible property—permitted carriage of a weapon. Paragraph (a) of this section does not apply as to carriage of firearms and other weapons if the individual is one of the following:\\n\\n(1) Law enforcement personnel required to carry a firearm or other weapons while in the performance of law enforcement duty at the airport.\\n\\n(2) An individual authorized to carry a weapon in accordance with §§ 1544.219, 1544.221, 1544.223, 1546.211, or subpart B of part 1562 of this chapter.\\n\\n(3) An individual authorized to carry a weapon in a sterile area under a security program.\",\"start\":771},{\"end\":900,\"field\":\"modality\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:886:900:sha256-533232681eac9dd2c357af3b24908d4c4e8d41562c911ad7ed51eb0f4638ccd0\",\"quote\":\"does not apply\",\"start\":886},{\"end\":1374,\"field\":\"choice_text\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:771:1374:sha256-af1a8c92b280b982ac594e1fcc08434ad2ae0eee06bd57850e156e234140fad1\",\"quote\":\"(b) On an individual's person or accessible property—permitted carriage of a weapon. Paragraph (a) of this section does not apply as to carriage of firearms and other weapons if the individual is one of the following:\\n\\n(1) Law enforcement personnel required to carry a firearm or other weapons while in the performance of law enforcement duty at the airport.\\n\\n(2) An individual authorized to carry a weapon in accordance with §§ 1544.219, 1544.221, 1544.223, 1546.211, or subpart B of part 1562 of this chapter.\\n\\n(3) An individual authorized to carry a weapon in a sterile area under a security program.\",\"start\":771},{\"end\":327,\"field\":\"scope_text:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:85:327:sha256-a32c8dfb7196d8707007190b60d5fd2a41cfc2faf3efbb1eecb19d61e6401457\",\"quote\":\"(a) On an individual's person or accessible property—prohibitions. Except as provided in paragraph (b) of this section, an individual may not have a weapon, explosive, or incendiary, on or about the individual's person or accessible property—\",\"start\":85},{\"end\":988,\"field\":\"scope_text:1\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:771:988:sha256-9b176610a451fc252606e5feec7a890a0e3330de336680f39d2efb15eb504cc3\",\"quote\":\"(b) On an individual's person or accessible property—permitted carriage of a weapon. Paragraph (a) of this section does not apply as to carriage of firearms and other weapons if the individual is one of the following:\",\"start\":771},{\"end\":1129,\"field\":\"alternative:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:990:1129:sha256-f63ba4358ff966ac514283f276f0c32e86dfc525ab2beea862985bb4ee9e53da\",\"quote\":\"(1) Law enforcement personnel required to carry a firearm or other weapons while in the performance of law enforcement duty at the airport.\",\"start\":990},{\"end\":1282,\"field\":\"alternative:1\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:1131:1282:sha256-9ab3e271d6219176b18a908e1e89635a5cbfeb67fd6a395dd3bcf59d3ad942c1\",\"quote\":\"(2) An individual authorized to carry a weapon in accordance with §§ 1544.219, 1544.221, 1544.223, 1546.211, or subpart B of part 1562 of this chapter.\",\"start\":1131},{\"end\":1374,\"field\":\"alternative:2\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:1284:1374:sha256-767b73a5ca31a741e65fb7e179b443fe99e4fac4dbe40a0ca0c7e7df93cee56a\",\"quote\":\"(3) An individual authorized to carry a weapon in a sterile area under a security program.\",\"start\":1284}],\"id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:revision:47744e9e62409b2abd5e0005cb5ef238f096cfc06a06caaa02ac5a0c8dfac4a3\",\"jurisdiction\":\"\",\"jurisdiction_quote\":\"\",\"kind\":\"exemption\",\"logic_text\":\"(b) On an individual's person or accessible property—permitted carriage of a weapon. Paragraph (a) of this section does not apply as to carriage of firearms and other weapons if the individual is one of the following:\\n\\n(1) Law enforcement personnel required to carry a firearm or other weapons while in the performance of law enforcement duty at the airport.\\n\\n(2) An individual authorized to carry a weapon in accordance with §§ 1544.219, 1544.221, 1544.223, 1546.211, or subpart B of part 1562 of this chapter.\\n\\n(3) An individual authorized to carry a weapon in a sterile area under a security program.\",\"meaning_assertion_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:b4fa5658818398dca12112a4cc0a95d15a526aba9789c3b9e1cc32052a81c0a0\",\"modality\":\"not_required\",\"modality_quote\":\"does not apply\",\"object\":\"\",\"occurrence_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:occurrence:dcf532599fa5d17c7052dc1498ac2089a6ba84d19e9b116a56978d5e65d03d5f\",\"origin\":\"aiSuggested\",\"quote\":\"(b) On an individual's person or accessible property—permitted carriage of a weapon. Paragraph (a) of this section does not apply as to carriage of firearms and other weapons if the individual is one of the following:\\n\\n(1) Law enforcement personnel required to carry a firearm or other weapons while in the performance of law enforcement duty at the airport.\\n\\n(2) An individual authorized to carry a weapon in accordance with §§ 1544.219, 1544.221, 1544.223, 1546.211, or subpart B of part 1562 of this chapter.\\n\\n(3) An individual authorized to carry a weapon in a sterile area under a security program.\",\"references\":[\"Paragraph (a)\",\"§§ 1544.219\",\"1544.221\",\"1544.223\",\"1546.211\",\"subpart B of part 1562\"],\"relation\":\"none\",\"rule_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:rule:eca944205a59dcfbe18eeee77a615e83e2d31b9b20ff5b479d7e6bf3d893fc21\",\"scope_quotes\":[\"(a) On an individual's person or accessible property—prohibitions. Except as provided in paragraph (b) of this section, an individual may not have a weapon, explosive, or incendiary, on or about the individual's person or accessible property—\",\"(b) On an individual's person or accessible property—permitted carriage of a weapon. Paragraph (a) of this section does not apply as to carriage of firearms and other weapons if the individual is one of the following:\"],\"scope_text\":\"As to carriage of firearms and other weapons on an individual's person or accessible property otherwise prohibited under paragraph (a) of 49 CFR 1540.111.\",\"section_id\":\"section-1\",\"start\":771,\"summary\":\"Paragraph (a) of 49 CFR 1540.111 does not apply as to carriage of firearms and other weapons if the individual is: (1) law enforcement personnel required to carry a firearm or other weapons while in the performance of law enforcement duty at the airport; (2) an individual authorized to carry a weapon in accordance with §§ 1544.219, 1544.221, 1544.223, 1546.211, or subpart B of part 1562 of this chapter; or (3) an individual authorized to carry a weapon in a sterile area under a security program.\",\"target_ids\":[],\"typed_values\":[]}",
