 not transport or offer for transport in checked baggage or in baggage carried in an inaccessible cargo hold under § 1562.23 of this chapter:\",\"start\":1376}],\"id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:revision:e9faa5fcdb00c87a102e5bcbcf3bf149bc2186ec4409ec2f2dd1e02941b645bd\",\"jurisdiction\":\"\",\"jurisdiction_quote\":\"\",\"kind\":\"prohibition\",\"logic_text\":\"(c) In checked baggage. A passenger may not transport or offer for transport in checked baggage or in baggage carried in an inaccessible cargo hold under § 1562.23 of this chapter:\",\"meaning_assertion_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:f03fa8000dcbd547a0299f1b738c85029a303da084d985e9133c1815f79f3bfb\",\"modality\":\"must_not\",\"modality_quote\":\"may not\",\"object\":\"\",\"occurrence_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:occurrence:79bd88523548a1dea68d06ea6ddd2c79ce65683ad1a7a6eeb77a3ab899508ed0\",\"origin\":\"aiSuggested\",\"quote\":\"(1) Any loaded firearm(s).\",\"references\":[\"§ 1562.23\"],\"relation\":\"none\",\"rule_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:rule:4b25775efbb1b5d504bd965b9b367d924cbfb907bfd62ea8d9c6a4eef443b750\",\"scope_quotes\":[\"(c) In checked baggage. A passenger may not transport or offer for transport in checked baggage or in baggage carried in an inaccessible cargo hold under § 1562.23 of this chapter:\"],\"scope_text\":\"For a passenger transporting or offering for transport in checked baggage or in baggage carried in an inaccessible cargo hold under § 1562.23 of this chapter.\",\"section_id\":\"section-1\",\"start\":1558,\"summary\":\"A passenger may not transport or offer for transport in checked baggage or in baggage carried in an inaccessible cargo hold under § 1562.23 of this chapter any loaded firearm(s).\",\"target_ids\":[],\"typed_values\":[]}",
