      "dcterms:description": "{\"action\":\"\",\"actor\":\"\",\"alternative_quotes\":[\"(i) The passenger declares to the aircraft operator, either orally or in writing, before checking the baggage, that the passenger has a firearm in his or her bag and that it is unloaded;\",\"(ii) The firearm is unloaded;\",\"(iii) The firearm is carried in a hard-sided container; and\",\"(iv) The container in which it is carried is locked, and only the passenger retains the key or combination.\"],\"applies_to\":[],\"assertion_ids\":[\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:efeb8bc6889e9bf76bbfa5f8fc05499196a86185fdc0e43ef603850ef6693d74\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:993b1996710bd322766fa0196bc138962ce1bb10621d6cb0ab7448be75a19adf\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:cb2442ebd611aead629a228a72fac100f50b33399b2a1403a7159a90eb5cdf83\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:ef1a15e1db2f4bc93ac562ff9a3c8957334c95e35df5d6e7c874315680ef9c44\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:dd7f5139fb58f9124cc774d977dc72b249cb6b1b97c6eff2bca2d6d094ff98e7\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:90ad7d29fa17e3adedd97181a93ab4d0cf5fd1a54db03a1194ac8549b2fa1db4\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:82dd169e2d1c35842d27ae4c0f0778b7353ecf82f3831e1639795595b74e84d2\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:3b514274ccf15d25e1bffe4a33fc774ccb437ee006bd50a4e8b0d62855522045\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:cd93cc619fe6a0c84fd7e34e93b08e3dee039b12bf77fd7e8560ab73422d2084\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:439d82ec565e436b8a7425d99b6fc3700f92ec0fc99b81785391a1a10b5cd1f3\"],\"choice_quote\":\"(2) Any unloaded firearm(s) unless—\\n\\n(i) The passenger declares to the aircraft operator, either orally or in writing, before checking the baggage, that the passenger has a firearm in his or her bag and that it is unloaded;\\n\\n(ii) The firearm is unloaded;\\n\\n(iii) The firearm is carried in a hard-sided container; and\\n\\n(iv) The container in which it is carried is locked, and only the passenger retains the key or combination.\",\"choice_text\":\"An unloaded firearm may not be transported or offered for transport unless all of the following hold: (i) the passenger declares to the aircraft operator, either orally or in writing, before checking the baggage, that the passenger has a firearm in his or her bag and that it is unloaded; (ii) the firearm is unloaded; (iii) the firearm is carried in a hard-sided container; and (iv) the container in which it is carried is locked, and only the passenger retains the key or combination.\",\"claimants\":[],\"concepts\":[],\"context_quotes\":[],\"effective_periods\":[],\"end\":2010,\"evidence\":[{\"end\":2010,\"field\":\"summary\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:1586:2010:sha256-55445821b85174dd35baccbe029635bc4b535d4c2fb27e8faef334a78e47a106\",\"quote\":\"(2) Any unloaded firearm(s) unless—\\n\\n(i) The passenger declares to the aircraft operator, either orally or in writing, before checking the baggage, that the passenger has a firearm in his or her bag and that it is unloaded;\\n\\n(ii) The firearm is unloaded;\\n\\n(iii) The firearm is carried in a hard-sided container; and\\n\\n(iv) The container in which it is carried is locked, and only the passenger retains the key or combination.\",\"start\":1586},{\"end\":2010,\"field\":\"logic_text\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:1586:2010:sha256-55445821b85174dd35baccbe029635bc4b535d4c2fb27e8faef334a78e47a106\",\"quote\":\"(2) Any unloaded firearm(s) unless—\\n\\n(i) The passenger declares to the aircraft operator, either orally or in writing, before checking the baggage, that the passenger has a firearm in his or her bag and that it is unloaded;\\n\\n(ii) The firearm is unloaded;\\n\\n(iii) The firearm is carried in a hard-sided container; and\\n\\n(iv) The container in which it is carried is locked, and only the passenger retains the key or combination.\",\"start\":1586},{\"end\":2010,\"field\":\"choice_text\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:1586:2010:sha256-55445821b85174dd35baccbe029635bc4b535d4c2fb27e8faef334a78e47a106\",\"quote\":\"(2) Any unloaded firearm(s) unless—\\n\\n(i) The passenger declares to the aircraft operator, either orally or in writing, before checking the baggage, that the passenger has a firearm in his or her bag and that it is unloaded;\\n\\n(ii) The firearm is unloaded;\\n\\n(iii) The firearm is carried in a hard-sided container; and\\n\\n(iv) The container in which it is carried is locked, and only the passenger retains the key or combination.\",\"start\":1586},{\"end\":1556,\"field\":\"scope_text:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:1376:1556:sha256-9dd5c9d0feb251838bff5c1a16b3c099ef083ecc7b0fca10625f4c8d5699fdf1\",\"quote\":\"(c) In checked baggage. A passenger may not transport or offer for transport in checked baggage or in baggage carried in an inaccessible cargo hold under § 1562.23 of this chapter:\",\"start\":1376},{\"end\":1809,\"field\":\"alternative:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:1623:1809:sha256-f6fe03740da837c967d5e1a19cc83bd62f4517d0b086d968201a40859ccf0a16\",\"quote\":\"(i) The passenger declares to the aircraft operator, either orally or in writing, before checking the baggage, that the passenger has a firearm in his or her bag and that it is unloaded;\",\"start\":1623},{\"end\":1840,\"field\":\"alternative:1\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:1811:1840:sha256-728d008fcfc79639161d8c2b1d0a6f86e145e04143be6ec504ef19d73771e1d6\",\"quote\":\"(ii) The firearm is unloaded;\",\"start\":1811},{\"end\":1901,\"field\":\"alternative:2\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:1842:1901:sha256-e6a871e22fdb4f04a0b00e20075aa0b5b737e6d1cb0fd25f4f29d5a90551bd62\",\"quote\":\"(iii) The firearm is carried in a hard-sided container; and\",\"start\":1842},{\"end\":2010,\"field\":\"alternative:3\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:1903:2010:sha256-8522eb345b969daa7d941fb54eecd07d2803856ad5eac836d5b26f452a52a60f\",\"quote\":\"(iv) The container in which it is carried is locked, and only the passenger retains the key or combination.\",\"start\":1903}],\"id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:revision:f1d2b6d1c12b04d8e8b34c752736c356fdebbbbba00a96595e9c94735c385d0b\",\"jurisdiction\":\"\",\"jurisdiction_quote\":\"\",\"kind\":\"prohibition\",\"logic_text\":\"(2) Any unloaded firearm(s) unless—\\n\\n(i) The passenger declares to the aircraft operator, either orally or in writing, before checking the baggage, that the passenger has a firearm in his or her bag and that it is unloaded;\\n\\n(ii) The firearm is unloaded;\\n\\n(iii) The firearm is carried in a hard-sided container; and\\n\\n(iv) The container in which it is carried is locked, and only the passenger retains the key or combination.\",\"meaning_assertion_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:439d82ec565e436b8a7425d99b6fc3700f92ec0fc99b81785391a1a10b5cd1f3\",\"modality\":\"must_not\",\"modality_quote\":\"may not\",\"object\":\"\",\"occurrence_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:occurrence:394400fc8f548c72e774c1bc041fd1a2b8a41d7c7954194ccaff54626fbf46d7\",\"origin\":\"aiSuggested\",\"quote\":\"(2) Any unloaded firearm(s) unless—\\n\\n(i) The passenger declares to the aircraft operator, either orally or in writing, before checking the baggage, that the passenger has a firearm in his or her bag and that it is unloaded;\\n\\n(ii) The firearm is unloaded;\\n\\n(iii) The firearm is carried in a hard-sided container; and\\n\\n(iv) The container in which it is carried is locked, and only the passenger retains the key or combination.\",\"references\":[\"§ 1562.23\"],\"relation\":\"none\",\"rule_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:rule:d80530a2a8de916fb15c010b27ba0f0e31a0b66606e8036c06da7aa107d6b578\",\"scope_quotes\":[\"(c) In checked baggage. A passenger may not transport or offer for transport in checked baggage or in baggage carried in an inaccessible cargo hold under § 1562.23 of this chapter:\"],\"scope_text\":\"For a passenger transporting or offering for transport in checked baggage or in baggage carried in an inaccessible cargo hold under § 1562.23 of this chapter.\",\"section_id\":\"section-1\",\"start\":1586,\"summary\":\"A passenger may not transport or offer for transport in checked baggage or in baggage carried in an inaccessible cargo hold under § 1562.23 of this chapter any unloaded firearm(s) unless: (1) the passenger declares to the aircraft operator, either orally or in writing, before checking the baggage, that the passenger has a firearm in his or her bag and that it is unloaded; (2) the firearm is unloaded; (3) the firearm is carried in a hard-sided container; and (4) the container in which it is carried is locked, and only the passenger retains the key or combination.\",\"target_ids\":[],\"typed_values\":[]}",
